#: ../../operations.rst:2228
msgid ""
"A command applies to new flows only. An established TCP stream, a UDP "
"mapping and a running HTTP exchange keep their server, as they do across "
"a reload. ``sibuna ctl`` exits with status 0 on success. On failure it "
"exits with status 1 and prints a diagnostic with a code from ``ADM001`` "
"to ``ADM013``, or ``DBA006`` and ``DBA009`` for the database authority, "
"and a hint, and nothing has changed. Part XII lists the codes."
msgstr ""
"Un comando solo se aplica a los flujos nuevos. Un flujo TCP establecido, "
"una asignación UDP y un intercambio HTTP en curso conservan su servidor, "
"como ocurre en una recarga. ``sibuna ctl`` termina con el estado 0 si "
"tiene éxito. Si falla, termina con el estado 1 e imprime un diagnóstico "
"con un código de ``ADM001`` a ``ADM013``, o ``DBA006`` y ``DBA009`` para "
"la autoridad de base de datos, y una pista, y no ha cambiado nada. La "
"parte XII enumera los códigos."

#: ../../operations.rst:2230
msgid ""
