#: ../../operations.rst:3122
msgid "``incident_receipts``"
msgstr "``incident_receipts``"

#: ../../operations.rst:3123
msgid ""
"Each node's durable incident receipt (the next sequence after its last "
"committed batch), keyed by node."
msgstr ""
"El recibo duradero de incidentes de cada nodo (la secuencia siguiente a "
